206
00:27:28.306 --> 00:27:31.306
We cannot just do with God what we want.

207
00:27:31.306 --> 00:27:34.306
He looks at holiness, at purity, at dedication.

208
00:27:34.306 --> 00:27:36.306
And yes.

209
