but when you see and taste that the Lord is good once,

495
00:53:15.286 --> 00:53:17.286
then you don't want it any other way.

496
00:53:20.286 --> 00:53:22.286
It becomes life, for He is life.

497
00:53:33.286 --> 00:53:36.286
So I want to encourage you, make time

498
00:53:36.286 --> 00:53:38.286
and let life flow from Him.

499
00:54:00.286 --> 00:54:02.286
And I want to ask you for commitment,

500
00:54:02.286 --> 00:54:06.286
but you do not assign yourself to me or to here.

501
00:54:08.286 --> 00:54:11.286
I want, if you feel and your heart is moved,

502
00:54:11.286 --> 00:54:14.286
that you dedicate yourself to rebuilding.

503
00:54:32.286 --> 00:54:40.286
And talk about it at home, talk about it with your partner.

504
00:54:40.286 --> 00:54:42.286
Make plans, that is all part of it.

505
00:54:42.286 --> 00:54:48.286
And then ask yourself the question, how will I dedicate myself to building the house?

506
00:54:50.286 --> 00:54:53.286
Lord, we love your glory.

507
00:54:53.286 --> 00:55:03.286
We want to be a billboard and a witness of the glory in the nation.

508
00:55:07.286 --> 00:55:11.286
Lion of the tribe of Judah, you will be praised.

509
00:55:13.286 --> 00:55:15.286
You will be praised.

510
00:55:15.286 --> 00:55:23.286
People will seek you and find you in this place.
